{"id":1111001,"name":"卢米尼塔·审查Ⅰ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"卢米尼塔·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1111001]}],"trial":{"trial_id":111001,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2025-05-27 14:00:00","diary1":"近期，新城某老城区频频传出闹鬼传闻，严重阻碍了拆迁进度。负责该片区开发的房地产商屡次向管理局施压，要求尽快批准卢米尼塔外出，协助凶宅鉴定，并平息谣言。\n　　与此同时，一项调查结果引起了你的注意——卢米尼塔经手的房产，无一例外都和狂厄脱不开关系。","diary2":"面对“窝藏死役”以及“利用死役打造凶宅”的指控，卢米尼塔供认不讳，但她也坚称这一切只是她谋利的手段，并没有其他的意图。\n　　你察觉到她仍有所隐瞒，却缺乏继续追问的线索。于是，你决定为卢米尼塔申请一天外出，利用老城区闹鬼一事探寻她真正的动机。","evidence":[{"ID":260737,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260738,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211001023,"next":null},{"step"